#~ msgid "Building AI Scientists"
#~ msgstr "构建人工智能科学家"

#~ msgid "Overview"
#~ msgstr "概述"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A customized AI scientist can be "
#~ "developed by integrating ToolUniverse with "
#~ "LLMs, reasoning models, and AI agents."
#~ " In this configuration, the LLMs and"
#~ " reasoning models provide the core "
#~ "capabilities for reasoning and tool "
#~ "usage, while ToolUniverse serves as the"
#~ " scientific environment for interaction and"
#~ " experimentation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "通过将 ToolUniverse 与大型语言模型（LLMs）、推理模型及 AI "
#~ "智能体集成，可以开发定制化的 AI 科学家。在此配置中，LLMs "
#~ "和推理模型提供推理及工具使用的核心能力，而 ToolUniverse 则作为科学环境，支持交互与实验。"

#~ msgid "The development process typically involves three steps:"
#~ msgstr "开发过程通常包括三个步骤："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Installing ToolUniverse with a single "
#~ "command (``pip install tooluniverse``)"
#~ msgstr "使用单条命令安装 ToolUniverse（``pip install tooluniverse``）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Connecting ToolUniverse to the chosen "
#~ "model so it can access the tools"
#~ " provided by ToolUniverse"
#~ msgstr "将 ToolUniverse 连接到所选模型，以便其能够访问 ToolUniverse 提供的工具"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Instructing the model to use these "
#~ "tools to address a given scientific "
#~ "problem"
#~ msgstr "指导模型使用这些工具来解决特定的科学问题"

#~ msgid "How AI Scientists Operate"
#~ msgstr "人工智能科学家的工作方式"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Once the setup is complete, the AI"
#~ " scientist operates as follows: given "
#~ "a user instruction or task, it "
#~ "formulates a plan or hypothesis, employs"
#~ " the tool finder in ToolUniverse to"
#~ " identify relevant tools, and iteratively"
#~ " applies these tools to gather "
#~ "information, conduct experiments, verify "
#~ "hypotheses, and request human feedback "
#~ "when necessary. For each required tool"
#~ " call, the AI scientist generates "
#~ "arguments that conform to the "
#~ "ToolUniverse protocol, after which "
#~ "ToolUniverse executes the tool and "
#~ "returns the results for further "
#~ "reasoning."
#~ msgstr "设置完成后，AI科学家的运行流程如下：针对用户指令或任务，制定计划或假设，利用ToolUniverse中的工具查找器识别相关工具，并迭代应用这些工具以收集信息、进行实验、验证假设，必要时请求人工反馈。对于每次所需的工具调用，AI科学家生成符合ToolUniverse协议的参数，随后ToolUniverse执行该工具并返回结果以供进一步推理。"

#~ msgid "Model Types"
#~ msgstr "模型类型"

#~ msgid "The models used to construct AI scientists can include:"
#~ msgstr "用于构建人工智能科学家的模型包括："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**LLMs**: API-based (GPT, Claude, "
#~ "Gemini) or open-weight models (LLaMA,"
#~ " DeepSeek, Qwen)"
#~ msgstr "**大型语言模型（LLMs）**：基于API的模型（GPT、Claude、Gemini）或开源权重模型（LLaMA、DeepSeek、Qwen）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Reasoning Models**: Enhance problem-solving"
#~ " capabilities by applying built-in "
#~ "chains of thought to analyze the "
#~ "current step before interacting with "
#~ "ToolUniverse"
#~ msgstr "**推理模型**：通过应用内置的思维链，在与ToolUniverse交互之前分析当前步骤，从而增强问题解决能力。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Agentic Systems**: Such as Gemini CLI"
#~ " or Claude Code, integrate reasoning "
#~ "models with agentic feedback loops to"
#~ " autonomously manage multi-step problem "
#~ "solving and tool use"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**智能智能体系统**：如 Gemini CLI 或 Claude "
#~ "Code，将推理模型与智能智能体反馈循环相结合，实现多步骤问题解决和工具使用的自主管理。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Specialized Agents**: Trained for specific"
#~ " scientific domains, enabling stronger "
#~ "performance on targeted tasks"
#~ msgstr "**专业智能体**：针对特定科学领域进行培训，提升在目标任务上的表现能力"
